      "content": "It is understandable that you are hesitant to go to the ER, but since you are experiencing new vision changes alongside swelling, it is very important to get professional advice. Do not take Ibuprofen or significantly change your fluid intake without consulting a doctor, as these things can impact pregnancy. Please call your doctor's office to see if there is an on-call nurse or a coverage provider who can advise you over the phone right away.",
