      "content": "i'm just so worried about the cost of the er and the hassle if it's nothing serious... honestly i feel totally fine physically besides being tired. if i just stay off my feet for the rest of the day and maybe try some warm baths to help the swelling, do you think it's safe enough to just wait until my appointment on tuesday? it's probably just being dramatic because of the hormones right?",
